OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of killing
OL,7,Fhis love rival with a samurai sword in
OL,8,FSomerset.
OL,10,FMichael Bretton, 41, killed Craig
OL,11,FHurcombe, a 39-year-old lorry driver
OL,12,Ffrom Devizes, after going to his
OL,13,Fcompany yard in Gurney Slade,
OL,14,FSomerset, on New Year's Day.
OL,16,FBretton, from Dorset, will be
OL,17,Fsentenced today.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
