FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FBristol Crown Court heard how Bretton
OL,7,Fhad previously had a casual fling with
OL,8,FKate Saunders, Mr Hurcombe's ex, which
OL,9,Fended in 2023.
OL,11,FThe court heard how Ms Saunders did
OL,12,Fnot want to take things further and
OL,13,Fthat she was on a break from Mr
OL,14,FHurcombe at the time she was seeing
OL,15,FBretton.
OL,17,FMs Saunders and Mr Hurcombe later
OL,18,Frekindled their relationship.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
