OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,F"I've never seen such obsessive
OL,7,Fbehaviour," says Detective Inspector
OL,8,FNeil Meade, from the Major Crime
OL,9,FInvestigation Team at Avon and
OL,10,FSomerset Police, who explains that at
OL,11,Fone point Bretton pretended to be
OL,12,Fanother female and sent messages to Ms
OL,13,FSaunders.
OL,15,F"He was saying things like, 'Michael's
OL,16,Fa good guy - give him a chance'".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FBristol Crown Court heard that from
OL,7,Flate last year, Bretton began waiting
OL,8,Fin his car outside Ms Saunders' home
OL,9,Ffor hours at a time, watching his love
OL,10,Frival, Mr Hurcombe, arriving and
OL,11,Fleaving.
OL,13,FBretton called police saying Ms
OL,14,FSaunders was in a coercive
OL,15,Frelationship with Mr Hurcombe and that
OL,16,Fshe had a restraining order against
OL,17,Fhim. Yet when police attended, the
OL,18,Fforce realised this was a lie.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FOn Christmas Eve, Bretton traced the
OL,7,Fcouple to a pub in Somerset where
OL,8,Fthere was a scuffle and Bretton
OL,9,Fsuffered a cut. Over the next few
OL,10,Fdays, things escalated further.
OL,12,FBretton had already bought two tracker
OL,13,Fdevices online and placed them in both
OL,14,FMs Saunders and Mr Hurcombe's cars.
OL,16,FTimeline of events on 1 January 2026
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FMr Hurcombe's parents reported him
OL,7,Fmissing on 10 January and Bretton was
OL,8,Farrested that night, where he was
OL,9,Ffound performing a factory reset on
OL,10,Fhis phone.
OL,12,FMr Hurcombe's body was discovered by
OL,13,Fsearch dogs in a shallow grave near
OL,14,Fhis work's yards on 14 January.
OL,16,FPolice were able to use Bretton's
OL,17,Ftracking devices as evidence against
OL,18,Fhim.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FPathologist Dr Amanda Jeffery, who
OL,7,Fcarried out a post-mortem examination
OL,8,Fon Mr Hurcombe's body, concluded he
OL,9,Fhad died from a single lengthy stab
OL,10,Finjury which penetrated through his
OL,11,Ftorso.
OL,13,FA samurai sword, which was rusty
OL,14,Fhaving been in water for some time,
OL,15,Fwas recovered from the River Stour
OL,16,Fnear the town of Sturminster Newton in
OL,17,Frecent weeks.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FBretton told the jury that he had gone
OL,7,Fto confront his love rival at the yard
OL,8,Fbut Mr Hurcombe had fallen from his
OL,9,Florry and died, and realising it
OL,10,Flooked bad, he buried his love rival's
OL,11,Fbody.
OL,13,FHowever, a jury of seven men and five
OL,14,Fwomen unanimously convicted him of the
OL,15,Fcharge following a two-week trial.
OL,17,FJudge William Hart told them: "There
OL,18,Fis only one sentence available if a
OL,19,Fperson is convicted of murder.
OL,26,@yD@_OU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,F"That is life imprisonment but in
OL,7,Forder to pass sentence, I have to
OL,8,Fdetermine the minimum term that Mr
OL,9,FBretton must serve before he is
OL,10,Feligible to be considered for release
OL,11,Fon licence."
OL,13,FThe judge paid tribute to the family
OL,14,Fof Mr Hurcombe, who he said had
OL,15,Fbehaved with "dignity and restraint"
OL,16,Fthroughout the trial.
OL,18,F"It is an extraordinary case," the
OL,19,Fjudge said.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@LO]wD@NOUwD@dO]zD@AOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,F"If you read about this case, you
OL,7,Fwould think it is something from a
OL,8,Fcrime novel."
OL,10,FProsecuting the case, Mark Cotter KC
OL,11,Fsaid Bretton had fitted trackers to
OL,12,Fthe cars of Ms Saunders and Mr
OL,13,FHurcombe.
OL,15,FHe told jurors this behaviour
OL,16,Fescalated, culminating in Bretton
OL,17,Fmurdering Mr Hurcombe.
OL,19,F"It was a pre-meditated and cold-
OL,20,Fblooded execution, carried out with
OL,21,Fthe use of a sword," Mr Cotter said.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@MO]{D@AOU}D@TO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785511095
OL,3,CMan found guilty of killing love rival
OL,4,Cwith samurai sword
OL,6,FHe added: "What is clear from the
OL,7,Fevidence is that Mr Bretton was
OL,8,Fobsessed with Kate Saunders and was
OL,9,Fclearly jealous of her renewed
OL,10,Frelationship with Craig Hurcombe."
OL,26,@nD@KOUrD@bO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/11
